    "The experiment extends evaluation beyond the prior two-object sandbox; numeric finiteness and C preservation alone do not establish reasonable completion. T1 mean remainder RMS 6.95316 %L; GT coverage 10.4187%; FF illegal affected free fraction 92.0250%. Visual review is separately owned by root.",
